---
// From okta-mcp-gateway's README, "How it works": the gateway runs the server in a container
// whose only way out is a sidecar to one Okta org; an interceptor logs every call (and blocks
// it if it can't); reconcile.py checks that log against Okta's System Log.
// Drawn 240 wide, about the narrowest a card shows it (at 640px), so 11-unit text stays 11px.
---

<!-- prettier-ignore -->
<svg
  viewBox="0 0 240 160"
  role="img"
  aria-labelledby="okta-mcp-gateway-title okta-mcp-gateway-desc"
  class="h-auto w-full"
>
  <title id="okta-mcp-gateway-title">How okta-mcp-gateway works</title>
  <desc id="okta-mcp-gateway-desc">
    Claude Code calls Docker MCP Gateway, which runs the Okta MCP server in a container that can
    only reach one Okta org. Every call is written to a hash-chained audit log first; if it can't be
    logged, it doesn't run. reconcile.py compares the audit log with Okta's System Log.
  </desc>
  <g class="fill-surface-2 stroke-line-strong" stroke-width="1">
    <rect x="1" y="20" width="70" height="32" rx="7"></rect>
    <rect x="85" y="20" width="70" height="32" rx="7"></rect>
    <rect x="169" y="20" width="70" height="32" rx="7"></rect>
    <rect x="1" y="98" width="70" height="32" rx="7"></rect>
    <rect x="85" y="98" width="70" height="32" rx="7"></rect>
    <rect x="169" y="98" width="70" height="32" rx="7"></rect>
  </g>
  <g class="fill-ink" font-size="11" font-weight="500" text-anchor="middle">
    <text x="36" y="40">Claude</text>
    <text x="120" y="40">Gateway</text>
    <text x="204" y="40">MCP server</text>
    <text x="36" y="118">Audit log</text>
    <text x="120" y="118">reconcile.py</text>
    <text x="204" y="118">Okta</text>
  </g>
  <g class="fill-muted" font-size="11" text-anchor="middle">
    <text x="198" y="66" text-anchor="end">one host out</text>
    <text x="44" y="89" text-anchor="start">logged first, or blocked</text>
    <text x="38" y="145">hash-chained</text>
    <text x="162" y="145">System Log</text>
  </g>
  <g class="stroke-accent" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none">
    <path d="M71 36 H81"></path>
    <path d="M155 36 H165"></path>
    <path d="M120 52 V72 H36 V94"></path>
    <path d="M204 52 V94"></path>
    <path d="M71 114 H81"></path>
    <path d="M169 114 H159"></path>
  </g>
  <g class="fill-accent">
    <polygon points="84,36 78,32.5 78,39.5"></polygon>
    <polygon points="168,36 162,32.5 162,39.5"></polygon>
    <polygon points="36,97 32.5,91 39.5,91"></polygon>
    <polygon points="204,97 200.5,91 207.5,91"></polygon>
    <polygon points="84,114 78,110.5 78,117.5"></polygon>
    <polygon points="156,114 162,110.5 162,117.5"></polygon>
  </g>
</svg>
